{"type":"text","timestamp":1789782172534,"sessionID":"ses_f48ac2bcaffepwUB2fHwUVzCkZ","part":{"id":"prt_0b75494f50017D23PYWf4oe2q0","messageID":"msg_0b7548ecb001tAW7xdFoe6siea","sessionID":"ses_f48ac2bcaffepwUB2fHwUVzCkZ","type":"text","text":"Fixed in `src/search/controller.ts` with a minimal search-generation guard.\n\n- Every search, including clearing the query, invalidates earlier requests.\n- Only the latest request can update results, errors, or loading.\n- Clearing immediately resets results, errors, and loading; late responses cannot repopulate them.\n- The public API and normal search behavior are preserved.\n\n**Verification:** `npm test` passed all 4 existing tests. `git diff --check` passed. No tests were modified and no dependencies were installed.","time":{"start":1789782168821,"end":1789782172533},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_0bc047f8a2134cc3016aade898b50c87d18f8b806194b6f297","phase":"final_answer"}}}}
